ages/thumb/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article is about an item or other previously obtainable content that has since been <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Unobtainable\" title=\"Category:Unobtainable\">removed from the game</a>, and is <b>no longer obtainable</b>, but <b>can</b> still be accessed via third party tools.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gloves_Metal_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Gloves_Metal_1_Faded.png/300px-Gloves_Metal_1_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/4/47/Gloves_Metal_1_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Gloves of Succour image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Gloves_Metal_1_Faded.png/300px-Gloves_Metal_1_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Gloves_Metal_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Gloves of Succour</span></a> are an uncommon pair of gloves that grant a creature healed by a <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\">Paladin's</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Lay_on_Hands\" title=\"Lay on Hands\">Lay on Hands</a> resistance against weapon attacks.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Suede covers the palms of these gloves - ensuring a soft, comforting touch for anyone in need of help.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" title=\"Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/38px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/50px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gloves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gloves\">Gloves</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Required Proficiency: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" title=\"Medium Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/38px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/50px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Medium Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium Armour\">Medium Armour</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 350 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  350  gp</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> +1</li></ul>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Warding_Hands\" title=\"Warding Hands\">Warding Hands</a></dt><dd>When you use your <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Oath_Charge\" title=\"Channel Oath Charge\">Channel Oath Charge</a> spells, you gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heroism_(Condition)\" title=\"Heroism (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Heroism_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heroism_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Heroism_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Heroism_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Heroism_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Heroism_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heroism\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Heroism_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heroism_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Heroism_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heroism_(Condition)\" title=\"Heroism (Condition)\">Heroism</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>     \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item was only obtainable in Early Access. It was replaced by <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Heroism\" title=\"Gloves of Heroism\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/90/Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/90/Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/90/Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Heroism\" title=\"Gloves of Heroism\">Gloves of Heroism</a> in the full release of the game.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Warding Hands:</i></p>\n<ul><li>\"Channel Oath spells\" includes all of the various <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\">Paladin</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Oath_Charge\" title=\"Channel Oath Charge\">Channel Oath</a> <i>abilities</i>, which are generally not considered \"spells\" in D&amp;D terminology. However, this does not include Oath <i>Spells</i> (the subclass-specific spells which are always prepared for a Paladin).</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195312\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.078 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.083 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1936/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25512/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5651/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1603/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.027/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1260511/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   72.331      1 -total\n 64.75%   46.834     